        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>Lich Faltyr has a number of contingencies at his disposal to prevent any unwelcome circumstances from befalling him. Before the fight, choose one contingency that Lich Faltyr has prepared. A contingency ability can only be used once.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.drifthaven-items.Item.stViX01BZ5LTIDfX]{Instant Revive | Tier 5}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.drifthaven-items.Item.vGfGe11aN6ssPtbB]{Inverted Silence}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.drifthaven-items.Item.W6weOsZ9POGWH7M8]{Synapse Overload | Tier 5}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.drifthaven-items.Item.AOaG1EGSIoc6hEqM]{Ghostly Visage | Tier 5}</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.drifthaven-items.Item.pDCEt7hMGVM5oeQy]{Ooze Form}</p>"
