        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> At least one soul cage is currently active.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Lich Faltyr gathers energy for a larger, more devastating magic against his foes. During Lich Faltyr’s next turn he can use the Grave Maker ability. If a soul cage is broken or disabled before Lich Faltyr’s next turn his concentration is broken and the energy dissipates preventing him from using Grave Maker.</p>"
        },
