        "category": null,
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Lich Faltyr channeled energy during his last turn.</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Each enemy within @Template[type:emanation|distance:100]{100 feet} takes [[/r (12d8)[bludgeoning]]] and must make succeed at a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:36|name:Grave Maker] save against the intense pull of Lich Faltyr’s magic.</p><p><br /><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.<br /><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} until the end of its next turn.<br /><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage and is knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}.<br /><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage and is pulled down through the ground. The target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.VcDeM8A5oI6VqhbM]{Restrained} and buried just beneath the surface and begins Suffocating at the end of their next turn. A buried creature must be dug up to be freed.</p><p>A buried creature or an ally can use a two-action activity that requires a free hand to dig free. This requires a successful @Check[type:Athletics|dc:32|name:Dig free] check.</p>"
        },
